High-Tech Hoax: X Tells Court Delhi Police Takedown Demand Was Fake

Social media platform X informed the Delhi High Court that legal notices demanding the removal of accounts belonging to Indian digital rights groups—including the Internet Freedom Foundation (IFF) and https://t.co/SNmSInsxL5—were fraudulent. An internal investigation revealed an impostor impersonated the Delhi police to issue the takedown orders. X had forwarded the notices to users before discovering they were fake, prompting legal challenges.

